# Crater Lair's coolant vat with a suit (CIPlay crater_lair_acidsuit, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). The suit
# box clvatsuits (14.6 -22.6) gives 180 s of suit; across the vat's zone cl_vat (18.5 -19.5) to the locker clvatlocker
# (20.5 -18.6) and back, unhurt, the acid still there. Floors ~5 m (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Crater Lair keep
offset 0.5101 0.0433
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
walk 9 -36 to 6 -30 to 6 -21 to 13 -21 to 14 -22
use clvatsuits
expect shown clvatacid
walk 14 -22 to 16 -20.5 to 18.5 -19.5 to 19.8 -18.9
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Vat room locker
wait 2
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
walk 19.8 -18.9 to 18.5 -19.5 to 16 -20.5 to 13 -21
expect unhurt
